# Input graph for the `activite_path` parameter of `visualisation` (see driver.py).
# Holds 3 instance(s) of :Activite, the class the region's query on g_activite selects,
# and a neighbourhood that this query must not match: instances of the five
# other tracked classes (so a query wired to the wrong graph, or a file parsed
# into the wrong graph, changes the result), the class reached by another
# predicate than rdf:type, and a same-named class in another namespace.
@prefix : <http://dig.isi.edu/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:activite_1 a :Activite .
:activite_2 a :Activite .
:activite_3 a :Activite .

:tache_in_activite a :Tache .
:historique_in_activite a :Generation .
:phenomene_in_activite a :Phenomene_Metier .
:domaine_in_activite a :Domaine .
:strategie_in_activite a :Strategie .
:activite_seeAlso rdfs:seeAlso :Activite .
<http://other.example/activite_9> a <http://other.example/Activite> .
